<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" /><title>Poly Dogfight</title><meta name="description" content="Fly a low-poly biplane around a tiny planet you can circle in about a minute. Weave through rock arches, needle spires, floating islands and the Great Rift canyon with momentum-based flight: keep your speed up or the wings stall. Up to four pilots share the screen with game controllers for split-screen dogfights: fixed guns with light aim assist, per-part battle damage, and two heat-seeking rockets on the wings that reload over time. Rockets turn slower than you do, so a hard bank can shake one, and a missed rocket coasts round the planet and may come back for its own pilot. Beginner steering banks and pulls for you; normal mode gives full manual control. Plays with keyboard, gamepad or touch, in any frame from a small widget to full screen."><meta name="napplet-id" content="poly-dogfight"><meta name="napplet-optional" content="config gamepad keys storage">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
    
